# Keep non-app trees out of Vercel builds/uploads. The worker deploys to the
# VPS via worker-deploy.yml; infra is provisioning config; migrations apply
# via supabase db push in CI (06-infra-cost.md §10).
#
# Patterns are ROOT-ANCHORED (leading slash) on purpose: a bare `supabase/`
# uses gitignore semantics and matches a dir of that name at ANY depth, which
# silently strips `src/lib/supabase/` (the app's Supabase clients) from the
# Vercel build. Anchor to the top-level trees only.
/worker/
/ingestion/
/infra/
/docs/
/supabase/
